  "description": "Connects the OASIS to BlueSky and the AT Protocol. Maps BlueSky user profiles to OASIS Avatars and posts (app.bsky.feed.post records) to OASIS Holons. Authentication via app passwords or OAuth. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
